# Implementation Plan: Pre-LangGraph Foundation for Interview Intelligence RAG

This implementation plan outlines all required core capabilities that must be built **before** introducing LangGraph. By building these foundational backend components first, the system will gain full multi-interview pattern detection, candidate-filtered RAG retrieval, and structured performance reporting via standard Python services and REST API endpoints.

**No codebase files will be edited until you approve this plan.**

---

